1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:16,133
为什么做 BlitzFair？限量发售被脚本垄断，普通人没机会
Why BlitzFair? Limited drops are monopolized by bots

2
00:00:16,133 --> 00:00:32,267
加验证码、限购只是抬高门槛，规则还是快者得
Captchas and limits only raise the bar — fastest still wins

3
00:00:32,267 --> 00:00:48,400
我们把「谁有资格买」从速度问题改成概率问题
We turn 'who gets to buy' from speed into probability

4
00:00:48,400 --> 00:00:54,400
BlitzFair · 把抢票从速度竞赛换成公开抽签
BlitzFair · Turning ticket rushes from a speed race into a public lottery

5
00:00:54,400 --> 00:01:08,400
这是公开仓库的 README：合约地址、网页端、完整开奖证据都在这里
Public README: contract address, web app, and full draw evidence

6
00:01:08,400 --> 00:01:18,400
打开网页端：不用安装，连接钱包就能走完提交 → 揭示 → 开奖 → 退款
Web app: no install — connect a wallet for commit → reveal → draw → refund

7
00:01:18,400 --> 00:01:28,400
四步全在一条链上：提交只交哈希，谁先谁后不影响结果
Four steps on one chain: commit sends only a hash — order doesn't matter

8
00:01:28,400 --> 00:01:36,400
发行方对账看板：谁下了单、中签多少、待退款多少，一目了然
Issuer dashboard: orders, winners, and pending refunds at a glance

9
00:01:36,400 --> 00:01:48,400
终端模拟：60 个抢购脚本 vs 44 个普通用户，限量 10 张
Terminal sim: 60 scalper bots vs 44 normal users, 10 tickets

10
00:01:48,400 --> 00:02:04,400
先到先得：普通用户 0/10。BlitzFair 抽签：人人等概率
First-come-first-served: 0/10 for users. Lottery: equal odds for everyone

11
00:02:04,400 --> 00:02:16,400
三窗口同屏：左边网页端实时数据，右上模拟器对照，右下链上实时查询
Three windows: web app (left), simulator (top-right), live chain (bottom-right)

12
00:02:16,400 --> 00:02:30,400
抽签下每个订单中签概率相同：9.6%，与下单先后无关
Every order has the same 9.6% chance — order doesn't matter

13
00:02:30,400 --> 00:02:40,400
诚实讲限制：抽签消除速度优势，不消除资金优势
Honest limits: lottery removes speed advantage, not money advantage

14
00:02:40,400 --> 00:02:50,400
所以对外只说「把速度竞赛换成公开抽签」，不说「杜绝黄牛」
We say public lottery — never scalper-proof

15
00:02:50,400 --> 00:03:06,400
守发售 Agent：设定一次，全自动走完提交 → 揭示 → 开奖 → 退款
Guardian agent: set once, auto-runs commit → reveal → draw → refund

16
00:03:06,400 --> 00:03:20,400
链上证据：15 人下单 → 15 人揭示 → 10 人中签，全部可查
On-chain evidence: 15 orders → 15 reveals → 10 winners, all verifiable

17
00:03:20,400 --> 00:03:26,400
先到先得 = 0 公平 · BlitzFair = 人人等概率
First-come-first-served = zero fairness · BlitzFair = equal odds
